WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
(lively music)
(audience cheers)

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:09.530
(audience applauds)

00:00:14.654 --> 00:00:15.487
- I'm risking...

00:00:15.487 --> 00:00:17.600
I'm risking Covid for them.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.028
(audience laughs)

00:00:19.028 --> 00:00:20.044
- I love you guys.
- [Both] We love you.

00:00:20.044 --> 00:00:20.877
- Thank you.

00:00:20.877 --> 00:00:23.490
See you in the next play on Broadway.

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:24.323
- [Both] Yeah.

00:00:24.323 --> 00:00:26.282
- Okay, but not for the same price.

00:00:26.282 --> 00:00:27.115
(both laughing)
(audience laughs)

00:00:27.115 --> 00:00:28.140
Okay, we'll talk.

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:30.270
This is very nice.

00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:31.680
Thank you so much.

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:33.063
This is beautiful.

00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:37.263
I gotta tell you, this means a lot to me.

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:39.603
It really means a lot.

00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:45.390
I feel so bad about the Oscar I got

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:49.020
for writing the original
screenplay for "The Producers".

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:51.390
I feel so, so bad.

00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:54.840
I miss it, I miss it so much.

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:56.688
I never should have sold it.

00:00:56.688 --> 00:00:59.040
(audience laughs)

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:02.715
Hey, listen, you know, times
weren't great, you know.

00:01:02.715 --> 00:01:05.548
(audience laughs)

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:12.020
But as comics often say and
don't mean it, seriously...

00:01:12.942 --> 00:01:15.775
(audience laughs)

00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:19.863
Seriously, I gotta blow my nose seriously.

00:01:19.863 --> 00:01:21.660
(audience laughs)

00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:25.050
Nobody else does things that I do, right?

00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:26.520
They're all different.

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:27.540
Sometimes...

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:29.883
Sometimes they're good,
sometimes they stink.

00:01:31.215 --> 00:01:32.556
(nose blowing)

00:01:32.556 --> 00:01:33.389
(audience laughs)

00:01:33.389 --> 00:01:34.330
This is medium.

00:01:34.330 --> 00:01:35.550
(audience laughs)

00:01:35.550 --> 00:01:36.764
It's just medium.

00:01:36.764 --> 00:01:39.597
(audience laughs)

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:42.780
What does one say?

00:01:42.780 --> 00:01:47.780
I mean, when your peers
appreciate your work

00:01:48.780 --> 00:01:51.933
and they salute you
with this golden statue,

00:01:53.730 --> 00:01:56.190
it means a great deal, it really does.

00:01:56.190 --> 00:02:01.010
Because I was the baby of four boys

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:06.010
and finally they got
to see me and kiss me.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:14.000
And it meant a lot to be
awarded a place in the family.

00:02:16.770 --> 00:02:19.683
And it's the same thing in show business.

00:02:21.726 --> 00:02:24.780
If you're fellow writers,
directors, actors,

00:02:24.780 --> 00:02:29.730
et cetera, like you and
appreciate your work,

00:02:29.730 --> 00:02:31.110
it means a lot.

00:02:31.110 --> 00:02:32.310
It means a whole lot.

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:34.770
And then, like I said, to salute you

00:02:34.770 --> 00:02:38.370
with this wonderful statue is...

00:02:38.370 --> 00:02:39.210
It's terrific.

00:02:39.210 --> 00:02:41.710
I won't sell this one, I swear to God.

00:02:41.710 --> 00:02:42.930
(audience laughs)

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:44.310
Okay, I've said...

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:46.290
I said everything I want to say

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:50.380
and I'm gonna listen to everybody else try

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:54.710
to make it after me. (laughs)

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:56.940
(audience laughs)

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:59.126
Anyway, bless you.
(audience applauds)

00:02:59.126 --> 00:03:02.709
(soaring orchestral music)

